": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821886_1341306650932751_1504352793844008887_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WJBtY9qFn8gQ7kNvwEA0BOk&_nc_oc=AdoXA49W79iDgERFu91cVJlOBfa591SUWc1hhIqn2k_WxQRqd4bZRJDhAkLPKaFaDBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRjY9ou87paxjUBFtVE4HnTPzfN3znf74UY2bQ2V6cScA&oe=6B0DCC02"}, "display_name": "XR Eye Trainer", "keywords": ["eyeexercises", "Visiontraining", "Saccade", "eyeworkout", "focustraining"], "long_description": "Build a healthy eye-movement habit in Mixed Reality.\n\nXR Eye Trainer guides you through short, focused routines:\n\u2022 Smooth Pursuit \u2014 follow the target horizontally and vertically\n\u2022 Diagonals \u2014 gentle diagonal tracking for variety\n\u2022 Target Hop \u2014 quick saccades to boost precision\n\u2022 Clock \u2014 clockwise/counter-clockwise drills for control\n\nWhy it works:\n\u2022 Clear voice cues and subtle ticks keep the rhythm\n\u2022 Short pop-up prompts between steps prevent guesswork\n\u2022 Wrist menu for instant Start/Stop and quick adjustments\n\u2022 Scenario mode runs a full routine automatically\n\nDesigned for comfort:\n\u2022 Mixed Reality keeps you aware of your room\n\u2022 Adjustable speed, size, and repetitions\n\u2022 No account required. Works fully offline. No ads.\n\nDisclaimer: XR Eye Trainer is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice. If you have any vision concerns, consult a professional.\n", "short_description": "Train your eyes in Mixed Reality. Guided routines, voice cues, easy results.\n\nMixed-reality eye exercises with step-by-step guidance and gentle sounds.\n\nEye workout in MR: smooth pursuit, saccades, clock drills\u2014simple and effective."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xr-meta.com/privacy-policy-xr-eye-trainer.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sergii Kulish", "support_website_url":